    "why": "LG error code",
    "name": "MalfunctionCode_XXX"
   }
  ],
  "enable": null,
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Default Device ID 9000; the AHU device is Device ID + 2.",
   "Device ID and network settings are set from the ACP's front-panel menu.",
   "Wire the AHU RS-485 line to CH5 on the ACP BACnet (indoor-unit lines use CH1-CH4)."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "The on/off command is sent to the unit whatever its current state.",
   "Mode commands are ignored by a unit that does not hold the mode-select right."
  ]
 },
